{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_128_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_128","textTraditional":"一、十有四年，春，衞殺其大夫孔達。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_128_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_128","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，壬申，曹伯壽卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_128_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_128","textTraditional":"三、晉侯伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_128_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_128","textTraditional":"四、秋，九月，楚子圍宋。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_128_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_128","textTraditional":"五、葬曹文公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_128_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_128","textTraditional":"六、冬，公孫歸父會齊侯於穀。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}